Wed Aug 19 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - Lyra OS Release <rodrigo@lyraos.com.br>

- Add a desktop profile page before the Wi-Fi one, offering the Lyra and
  GNOME Vanilla profiles that Vega's Personalização screen already exposes.
- Switch profiles through the same key Vega uses, toggling only
  sheliak@lyraos.com.br in org.gnome.shell enabled-extensions.
- Offer the Lyra profile only when the Sheliak extension is installed.
- Declare the glib2-tools dependency for gsettings.
- Normalize Cargo's vendored-source path before archiving so repeated source
  generation produces identical artifacts outside the temporary build path.

